---
import UnderConstructionNotice from '../components/UnderConstructionNotice.astro';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="About Us | Nova Detailing"
  description="Learn more about Nova Detailing, the team behind our mobile detailing services, and what drives our work across Kentville and the Annapolis Valley."
  canonicalPath="/about"
  showNavbar={false}
  showFooter={false}
  showChatWidget={false}
>
  <UnderConstructionNotice />

  <main class="about-section">
    <section>
      <h1>About Nova Detailing</h1>
      <p>Nova Detailing began as a passion project between three university students — <strong>Liam Keats</strong>, <strong>Ben Waterbury</strong>, and <strong>Elijah Kroezen</strong>. While juggling coursework and student life, we decided to create something of our own: a locally-rooted business with the goal of delivering high-end detailing services to the Annapolis Valley and beyond.</p>

      <p>What started as a summer hustle has quickly grown into a professional operation, with over <strong>100 vehicles detailed</strong> and partnerships with multiple local dealerships. We clean everything — cars, trucks, boats, fleet vehicles, and luxury rides — all through our 100% <strong>mobile detailing service</strong>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>To bring professional, detail-oriented car care directly to your driveway — combining the hustle of young entrepreneurs with the quality and precision you'd expect from a premium service. We believe in delivering exceptional results with flexibility, transparency, and a customer-first attitude.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>✔️ 100% mobile — we come to you, anywhere in the Valley</li>
        <li>✔️ Fair pricing with high-end results</li>
        <li>✔️ Trusted by local dealerships and hundreds of happy customers</li>
        <li>✔️ Fast, flexible service that works around your schedule</li>
        <li>✔️ Extreme attention to detail — we treat every vehicle like it's our own</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
